    <briefdescription>
<para>Provide extra details about the machine processor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a collection of &quot;optional&quot; processor information that is not normally used by the LLVM machine schedulers, but that can be consumed by external tools like llvm-mca to improve the quality of the peformance analysis. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
